sign cites `occurrences` at `:1589-1609`; `cc1` added [`application-occurrences`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm.cljc#L1612-L1623) immediately below it.\n   - **`src/cljc/yin/vm/encoder.cljc`**: Design cites `:232-279`; on `master` after `cc1`, C1 validation and `program-batch` are at [`:237-345`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/encoder.cljc#L237-L345).\n   - **`src/cljc/yin/vm/macro.cljc`**: Design cites `expand-all` (`:786-862`), `event-row` (`:1012-1025`), `expand-batch` (`:1303-1380`), `step`/`load` (`:1453-1556`). On `master` after `cc1`, these are at [`expand-all` (`:1060-1156`)](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/macro.cljc#L1060-L1156), [`event-row` (`:1290-1304`)](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/macro.cljc#L1290-L1304), [`expand-batch` (`:1630-1745`)](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/macro.cljc#L1630-L1745), and [`step`/`call-site-table`/`load` (`:1818-1882`)](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/macro.cljc#L1818-L1882).\n   - **`src/cljc/yin/vm/linker/publish.cljc`**: Design cites `publish-closure!` (`:123-214`) and `module-from-index` (`:282-391`). On `master` after `cc1` and `83b52a0b`, `publish-closure!` is at [`:242-386`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/linker/publish.cljc#L242-L386), `published-call-site-table` is at [`:434-480`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/linker/publish.cljc#L434-L480), and `module-from-index` is at [`:562-635`](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/linker/publish.cljc#L562-L635).\n   - **`test/yang/latte_oracle_test.clj`**: Design cites `kernel-stamp-sites` (`:1945-2040`), `kernel-site-table` (`:2043-2104`), `kernel-compile` (`:2112-2126`), `kernel-c` (`:2220-2283`), `write-kernel-gate-evidence!` (`:3230-3265`). On `master` after `0f04212b`, these are at [`kernel-stamp-sites` (`:1983-2074`)](file:///Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/test/yan